settings-general-notes-title = What's new after an update
settings-general-notes-about = Once per version. The notes are always under Lightforge Updates.
settings-general-updates-title = Tell me about new releases
settings-general-updates-about = Asks GitHub once at startup. Nothing is downloaded.
settings-general-updates-hint = Your package manager owns the program, so the notice is a link to the releases page. DISCLAIMER.md lists this along with everything else Lightforge contacts.
