settings-general-interface-size-hint = The window grows with it, up to nine tenths of the screen, and shrinks below 100% when it would not fit at all. On Wayland it grows from its top-left corner: a window there cannot move itself.
settings-general-controller-title = Controller and touch
settings-general-controller-about = Fullscreen, larger controls and button hints, for a Steam Deck or a TV.
settings-general-controller-hint = Setup asks on SteamOS; this changes the answer.
