settings-battlenet-wayland-title = Wayland backend
settings-battlenet-wayland-hint = Newer and less travelled than the X11 path, so it is off until asked for.
settings-battlenet-intro = These apply to Battle.net and every game it starts.
settings-battlenet-hint = They cannot be set per game, because Lightforge only gets to choose the environment when it starts the client itself: a client that is already open is handed the launch over its own message queue.
