settings-proton-downgrade-warning = ⚠ The pin for { $games } points to a build older than the { $build } that last upgraded the prefix. There is one prefix for everything here, and Proton only migrates it forward, so an older build may leave it in a state the newer one did not expect. You will be asked again at launch.
settings-proton-shop-hint = World of Warcraft's in-game shop and support pages only render under { $build }. Newer builds start the game's embedded browser and lose its GPU process, which is the grey box instead of a page. Everything else about the game is unaffected — install it under Builds below, then pin it here.
